WEBVTT

00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:16.884
Abiru hodo dakiattari kuchizuke shitari

00:00:16.884 --> 00:00:23.090
Abiru hodo kenka shitari aishiattari

00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:29.296
Ari no mama omae no koto shiritai kuse ni

00:00:29.296 --> 00:00:35.035
Ari no mama nante narenai ore no hou sa

00:00:35.168 --> 00:00:38.171
Wakaranai

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.908
Omae no kokoro ga

00:00:41.341 --> 00:00:42.910
Nazedayo

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:47.548
Honto wa majutsushi kai?

00:00:48.782 --> 00:00:51.718
Dakishimetai

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:55.322
Hitori ja cry

00:00:55.322 --> 00:00:59.993
Mou nido to hitori ja itakunai

00:01:01.328 --> 00:01:04.331
Dakishimetai

00:01:04.331 --> 00:01:07.634
Omae to fly

00:01:08.035 --> 00:01:15.409
Marude naiteru youna kanjiteru koe ni toketeiku

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:21.915
Serenade

00:01:37.531 --> 00:01:38.365
Here!

00:01:42.736 --> 00:01:43.737
This is...

00:01:44.605 --> 00:01:47.507
There really aren't many
red ones, are there?

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:49.476
It took a little time.

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:51.144
You were looking for this?

00:01:51.478 --> 00:01:55.616
It would be nice if your wish came true, Orphen.

00:02:00.087 --> 00:02:01.188
Cleao...

00:02:16.670 --> 00:02:17.504
Orphen!

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:28.849
...always something else...

00:02:30.751 --> 00:02:32.819
...that brings forth from within...

00:02:34.121 --> 00:02:36.156
...as pure as water...

00:02:39.926 --> 00:02:41.928
If you have all of these,

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:45.132
the true power of the Sword of
Baltanders will be released.

00:02:47.534 --> 00:02:48.468
But...

00:02:58.111 --> 00:03:02.315
The immensity of that power
may take your life at the same time.

00:03:02.616 --> 00:03:05.719
Then, what was written at the missing part was...

00:03:14.161 --> 00:03:15.328
Orphen!

00:03:40.287 --> 00:03:41.621
It's coming into view.

00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:46.460
Alenhatan...

00:03:54.701 --> 00:04:00.774
pUZZ1€d BLUE €YES

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:09.282
Timothy,

00:04:09.282 --> 00:04:10.917
I'm ho me!

00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:13.720
You must have been so lonely!

00:04:14.488 --> 00:04:16.723
They're passionate, aren't they, Master?

00:04:16.723 --> 00:04:19.426
Yeah, and they're both guys.

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:35.909
Wait just a while longer, okay everyone?

00:04:35.909 --> 00:04:37.611
Il make something really good, all right?

00:04:37.611 --> 00:04:40.280
Yeah, make it really good!

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.815
Leave it to me!

00:04:41.815 --> 00:04:47.854
Say, Master, is the Jewel of Gigabrious
really at the Tower of Fangs?

00:04:48.221 --> 00:04:51.558
| don't know. But the possibility
is the greatest there.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:54.361
Oh dear, dear...

00:04:54.361 --> 00:04:56.863
Why do you have to sigh?

00:04:56.863 --> 00:05:01.368
Because that means that we have to
cause another scene, right?

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:04.504
Well, yeah.

00:05:05.238 --> 00:05:08.241
Well, you don't have to come with me
if you don't want to, Majic.

00:05:09.576 --> 00:05:12.779
Aren't you just saying that
because you know I'm coming with you?

00:05:15.348 --> 00:05:16.583
Geez...

00:05:17.684 --> 00:05:19.352
What is it, Cleao?

00:05:21.087 --> 00:05:23.023
Oh, it's nothing.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:26.326
Cleao, you've been acting weird lately.

00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:27.527
What's wrong?

00:05:28.028 --> 00:05:29.529
N-nothing, really.

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:31.398
Cleao?

00:05:33.767 --> 00:05:35.969
Sorry, I'm going out for a while.

00:05:35.969 --> 00:05:37.204
Come on, Leki.

00:05:43.677 --> 00:05:47.147
You said something to break
a girl's heart again, didn't you?

00:05:47.147 --> 00:05:48.748
A girl's heart?

00:06:00.293 --> 00:06:05.298
| wonder how long ago it was
when I was still me?

00:06:06.099 --> 00:06:08.802
This flower doesn't know me.

00:06:36.730 --> 00:06:38.431
Did you get it, Hartia?

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:40.100
It's no good, Krylancelo.

00:06:40.100 --> 00:06:41.868
| can't reach it after all.

00:06:42.302 --> 00:06:43.570
Why don't you stand on my shoulders?

00:06:44.004 --> 00:06:45.839
Oh, yeah!

00:06:54.881 --> 00:06:56.583
What are you doing?!

00:06:56.583 --> 00:06:59.019
It's because you weren't
holding me right, isn't it, Krylancelo?

00:06:59.185 --> 00:07:01.554
It's because you weren't
standing right, Hartia!

00:07:05.225 --> 00:07:06.826
Master Childman!

00:07:07.694 --> 00:07:08.795
To me.

00:07:13.566 --> 00:07:14.668
Thanks...

00:07:18.571 --> 00:07:20.273
Don't rough house in the library.

00:07:20.273 --> 00:07:21.141
Yes...

00:07:21.141 --> 00:07:22.409
I'm sorry.

00:07:34.788 --> 00:07:36.790
We have to become sorcerers, okay?

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:37.757
Yeah...

00:07:37.757 --> 00:07:39.759
Let's be like Childman!

00:07:40.293 --> 00:07:41.328
Yeah!

00:07:44.364 --> 00:07:46.366
So, you picked it up?

00:07:46.766 --> 00:07:47.767
Master!

00:07:49.269 --> 00:07:53.239
Sorry, I just missed the right time
to give it back to you.

00:07:55.508 --> 00:07:56.910
You need not return it.

00:07:58.244 --> 00:07:59.746
You've taken a liking to it, haven't you?

00:07:59.746 --> 00:08:01.681
But, Master...

00:08:02.382 --> 00:08:03.850
Researching something?

00:08:04.918 --> 00:08:05.919
Yes...

00:08:05.919 --> 00:08:07.587
With such enthusiasm...

00:08:08.188 --> 00:08:09.923
So then, with this...

00:08:23.536 --> 00:08:26.906
Please, don't look so sad, Flameheart.

00:08:27.207 --> 00:08:33.413
Mother, I'm sure my attack went through
Bloody August's forehead.

00:08:33.413 --> 00:08:34.714
I'm sure...

00:08:34.914 --> 00:08:35.949
And?

00:08:35.949 --> 00:08:37.283
But it...

00:08:37.283 --> 00:08:39.486
You did well, you know.

00:08:39.486 --> 00:08:43.923
Everyone says so too,
that you fought a glorious battle.

00:08:43.923 --> 00:08:46.326
You're my pride, my son.

00:08:46.326 --> 00:08:49.562
So, please don't look so sad.

00:08:49.763 --> 00:08:50.930
But...

00:09:06.846 --> 00:09:09.315
But he laughed.

00:09:09.582 --> 00:09:14.120
At me, who couldn't defeat
Bloody August. At me!

00:09:14.921 --> 00:09:19.025
| failed. I can't surpass Childman!

00:09:19.025 --> 00:09:21.261
It's all right. It's all right.

00:09:21.528 --> 00:09:23.663
Leave it to Mother now.

00:09:38.711 --> 00:09:40.046
He's back!

00:09:41.047 --> 00:09:42.048
Did you find her?

00:09:42.048 --> 00:09:42.949
No...

00:09:42.949 --> 00:09:43.950
| see.

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.252
Where do you think Cleao could've gone?

00:09:48.088 --> 00:09:51.057
What are you making, Master?

00:09:51.057 --> 00:09:52.892
A house for this guy.

00:09:55.395 --> 00:09:56.930
How cute!

00:09:57.263 --> 00:10:00.166
He says he's going to fix it
because the nest box was breaking.

00:10:00.533 --> 00:10:02.969
He didn't have to do it
right now though, did he?

00:10:04.437 --> 00:10:07.774
He wants to distract himself, right, Orphen?

00:10:07.774 --> 00:10:10.276
Because he's worried about you-know-who.

00:10:12.212 --> 00:10:13.446
Master?

00:10:13.446 --> 00:10:15.315
You're wrong, stupid.

00:10:15.849 --> 00:10:18.017
Really, you just aren't honest with yourself!

00:10:20.086 --> 00:10:23.423
Miss Stephanie, I'll go look again.

00:10:23.756 --> 00:10:26.025
I'll try wherever I can think of too.

00:10:26.025 --> 00:10:29.229
Yes! Then I'll go now, Master.

00:10:29.529 --> 00:10:31.431
Just shut up and go.

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.765
Oh, sorry!

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.369
Sorry, Leki.

00:11:15.642 --> 00:11:20.647
At times people express their love
in a paradoxical fashion.

00:11:21.381 --> 00:11:24.217
What's that? It's not like that.

00:11:24.217 --> 00:11:26.219
| said it's not like that!

00:11:26.819 --> 00:11:28.021
It's not...

00:11:31.925 --> 00:11:33.993
Oh, geez!

00:12:13.967 --> 00:12:17.136
Let it go. You still can't fly yet.

00:12:17.136 --> 00:12:20.373
You can try after your feathers have all grown in.

00:12:36.556 --> 00:12:38.057
Where have you been?

00:12:38.057 --> 00:12:39.859
Majic and the others have been looking for you.

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.498
I'm sorry.

00:12:58.177 --> 00:13:02.148
Say, Orphen, how do you think to
do things all the time?

00:13:02.815 --> 00:13:04.150
What are you talking about?

00:13:04.150 --> 00:13:08.788
Have you ever thought, "I might fail,"
before you did something?

00:13:08.788 --> 00:13:09.989
Fail?

00:13:10.556 --> 00:13:14.327
If you think something like that
before you do it, there's no way it'll go good.

00:13:14.327 --> 00:13:16.963
You succeed because you think
you're going to succeed.

00:13:16.963 --> 00:13:19.799
Is that so? Yeah, that's right.

00:13:20.166 --> 00:13:22.568
That's the kind of person you are, right, Orphen?

00:13:23.369 --> 00:13:26.339
Hey, you'd be lonely if someone

00:13:26.339 --> 00:13:29.475
that was beside you until yesterday
disappeared today, wouldn't you?

00:13:29.475 --> 00:13:31.277
It'd be really lonely, wouldn't it?

00:13:31.511 --> 00:13:32.512
Cleao!

00:13:39.385 --> 00:13:42.989
What Rocks Row said, it's true, isn't it?

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:46.092
Orphen, I...

00:13:46.826 --> 00:13:47.960
I..

00:13:49.462 --> 00:13:52.031
What, Cleao? You're back!

00:13:52.031 --> 00:13:54.967
Geez, I looked all over the place...

00:14:20.493 --> 00:14:23.296
Hey, how long do you plan on staying here?

00:14:23.296 --> 00:14:26.199
It's been a week already!
Hurry up and fly away already!

00:14:26.566 --> 00:14:31.471
At this rate, your savior will become
a fossil from sheer boredom!

00:14:33.039 --> 00:14:34.307
It moved!

00:14:35.975 --> 00:14:38.378
It's gonna fly! Jump on, Dortin!

00:14:39.145 --> 00:14:40.480
Wait!

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:41.514
Here we go!

00:14:41.514 --> 00:14:42.415
Big Brother!

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:48.221
What?

00:14:48.221 --> 00:14:49.188
It's not flying.

00:14:49.188 --> 00:14:51.524
Hey, you, if you're not going to fly

00:14:51.524 --> 00:14:56.095
don't do those "Okay-now-I'm-going-to-fly,"
kind of misunderstandable movements!

00:15:00.166 --> 00:15:02.535
Hey, are you listening, idiot?!

00:15:06.272 --> 00:15:07.774
Are you lonely?

00:15:08.808 --> 00:15:10.243
Are you sad?

00:15:14.414 --> 00:15:16.048
Do you want to go somewhere?

00:15:16.816 --> 00:15:18.985
Or maybe you want to see someone?

00:15:29.729 --> 00:15:33.166
It's crying, just like a person.

00:15:42.408 --> 00:15:45.144
This kind of thing just isn't like me, is it?

00:15:47.613 --> 00:15:49.682
So you understand me, Leki?

00:15:52.251 --> 00:15:53.252
Who?

00:16:06.666 --> 00:16:08.401
Shrimp Man...

00:16:08.401 --> 00:16:10.703
What? Are you worried about something?

00:16:10.703 --> 00:16:13.272
Aren't you going to do that weird,
boastful introduction today?

00:16:13.272 --> 00:16:14.373
Well, no.

00:16:19.445 --> 00:16:22.048
This is my identity.

00:16:22.849 --> 00:16:24.383
You are...

00:16:25.518 --> 00:16:27.019
Are you surprised?

00:16:27.487 --> 00:16:29.088
Who are you?

00:16:41.200 --> 00:16:44.203
The true power of the Sword of Baltanders?

00:16:44.203 --> 00:16:46.839
So, Rocks Row said that?

00:16:46.839 --> 00:16:49.342
We've got our hands on
the sword and the bracelet.

00:16:49.342 --> 00:16:54.881
All we need is the blue gemstone
called the Jewel of Gigabrious.

00:16:54.881 --> 00:16:56.516
Gigabrious...

00:16:57.183 --> 00:16:58.784
Blue gemstone...

00:17:01.487 --> 00:17:04.290
Are you worried? About Krylancelo?

00:17:20.039 --> 00:17:21.307
We'll succeed!

00:17:22.508 --> 00:17:24.544
Orphen won't fail!

00:17:27.213 --> 00:17:29.148
Is that so?

00:17:29.982 --> 00:17:31.250
That's right!

00:17:32.685 --> 00:17:34.086
That's...

00:17:34.086 --> 00:17:36.989
It seems Master Childman had it all this time,

00:17:36.989 --> 00:17:39.725
probably for the same goal as Krylancelo.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:42.828
But now it's in my hands, like this.

00:17:43.129 --> 00:17:44.297
What does that mean?

00:17:44.297 --> 00:17:46.432
Master has changed.

00:17:46.632 --> 00:17:50.236
No, maybe Master is a different person now.

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:55.841
To tell the truth, I came to tell
Krylancelo that, but...

00:17:56.776 --> 00:17:58.878
| can't tell him after all.

00:18:00.146 --> 00:18:03.249
It'll just torture him again.

00:18:04.183 --> 00:18:05.451
Shrimp Man...

00:18:05.451 --> 00:18:06.919
That's why...

00:18:07.186 --> 00:18:09.288
Why me?

00:18:09.288 --> 00:18:14.293
Because you're the person closest to
Krylancelo, closer than even I.

00:18:15.494 --> 00:18:18.564
Because you are the person
who cares for Krylancelo the most.

00:18:19.332 --> 00:18:20.299
Now...

00:18:22.802 --> 00:18:28.274
And with the Jewel of Gigabrious
the power will be released.

00:18:30.543 --> 00:18:33.379
No, I can't take it.

00:18:36.649 --> 00:18:39.619
Because I'm not!

00:18:41.554 --> 00:18:42.488
Cleao!

00:18:43.456 --> 00:18:46.092
Because I'm not like that!

00:18:46.592 --> 00:18:48.294
Wait, Cleao!

00:18:48.294 --> 00:18:49.295
Cleao!

00:18:54.467 --> 00:18:56.936
Please wait, Master.

00:18:56.936 --> 00:18:59.038
I'm just going on a walk.

00:18:59.438 --> 00:19:00.773
But...

00:19:03.876 --> 00:19:05.277
That baby...

00:19:06.979 --> 00:19:08.614
What an idiot.

00:19:09.015 --> 00:19:10.616
Is it dead?

00:19:11.283 --> 00:19:14.186
He couldn't even fly,
but he tried too hard.

00:19:15.788 --> 00:19:17.523
He couldn't even fly?

00:19:18.124 --> 00:19:23.596
The true power of Baltanders
may take your life at the same time.

00:19:24.597 --> 00:19:26.799
Hey, you'd be lonely if someone

00:19:26.799 --> 00:19:30.102
that was beside you until yesterday
disappeared today, wouldn't you?

00:19:32.905 --> 00:19:34.106
Master?

00:19:34.540 --> 00:19:35.741
Die?

00:19:39.545 --> 00:19:41.380
What did you need to speak of?

00:19:43.449 --> 00:19:46.719
| said that I'd give you that gemstone.

00:19:46.719 --> 00:19:49.221
So, it's really all right if I accept it?

00:19:49.221 --> 00:19:50.389
What?

00:19:50.790 --> 00:19:53.192
The Heavenly Beings
created many magical items.

00:19:53.192 --> 00:19:57.930
For the true power of Baltanders,
the Jewel of Gigabrious...

00:19:58.497 --> 00:19:59.699
What did you say?

00:20:02.535 --> 00:20:05.271
Do not tell me that you did not know?

00:20:07.673 --> 00:20:09.775
You didn't know did you?

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:14.513
Master Childman, you are-

00:20:17.817 --> 00:20:19.785
Lai? This is...

00:20:21.153 --> 00:20:22.955
O lce of Silence!

00:20:23.222 --> 00:20:24.223
O wall!

00:20:29.962 --> 00:20:31.363
You are...

00:20:37.436 --> 00:20:38.437
O Wind!

00:20:43.709 --> 00:20:44.844
O Light!

00:20:59.625 --> 00:21:01.127
Hartia...

00:21:13.038 --> 00:21:14.874
I'm such a kid, aren't 1?

00:21:14.874 --> 00:21:16.742
Hopelessly so, right?

00:21:17.376 --> 00:21:22.248
But right now I can only act like this.

00:21:27.419 --> 00:21:29.455
| don't want Orphen to die.

00:21:29.455 --> 00:21:30.856
That's all right.

00:21:32.158 --> 00:21:33.325
That's okay, isn't it?

00:21:38.697 --> 00:21:40.599
Well, let's go inside.

00:21:48.974 --> 00:21:50.476
Shrimp Man!

00:21:50.476 --> 00:21:52.444
Get a hold of yourself!

00:21:52.444 --> 00:21:53.746
Hartia!

00:21:57.383 --> 00:21:58.884
This...

00:22:16.735 --> 00:22:20.139
Azalie and Childman's souls are interchanged?!

00:22:20.139 --> 00:22:24.143
Are you saying Azalie wasn't the
kind of person I thought she was?!

00:22:24.643 --> 00:22:28.047
Azalie, tell me everything about you now!

00:22:28.047 --> 00:22:34.353
Everything you feel, and accept
my feelings and Childman's feelings!

00:22:34.887 --> 00:22:36.755
Next time on Sorcerous Stabber Orphen:

00:22:36.755 --> 00:22:38.357
SORCERESS AZalle
"Sorceress Azalie."

00:22:38.357 --> 00:22:40.860
SORCERESS aZalig
Sword of Light, whom I do release!

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:41.760
SORCERESS AZalle

00:22:43.195 --> 00:22:44.730
Doushiyou

00:22:44.730 --> 00:22:47.132
Oikakete kurenakya

00:22:47.132 --> 00:22:51.370
Konomama zun zun to aruitatte

00:22:52.938 --> 00:22:54.506
Doushiyou

00:22:54.506 --> 00:22:56.942
Aenaku naru yo

00:22:56.942 --> 00:23:01.247
Keitai denwa o shittetatte

00:23:01.814 --> 00:23:06.685
Headlights watashi o terasu

00:23:06.685 --> 00:23:10.990
Mabushi sugite me o tojiru

00:23:11.624 --> 00:23:14.026
Heels nugisutete

00:23:14.026 --> 00:23:16.495
Ryoute ni moteba

00:23:16.495 --> 00:23:21.567
Pride nanka mo sutechaeru

00:23:21.734 --> 00:23:30.309
Hajimete sugoku hikyou na mo shisou na no yo

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:42.187
Kono mama michi ni taorekonde nakijakuritai

00:23:43.122 --> 00:23:47.626
Looking for you and fall in love

00:23:48.360 --> 00:23:52.564
Tsuyoku mo so naindakara

00:23:53.299 --> 00:23:57.369
Ima kiss o saretara

00:23:58.103 --> 00:24:02.808
Naichauyo doushiyou

00:24:03.008 --> 00:24:08.814
<i>Kono koi 0 doushiyou</i>
